{"2827720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Drylands", "steam_appid": 2827720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Drylands is a Car RPG set in an ever-changing world that changes every run as an ancient power shifts the sands revealing previously uncovered secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like the world, enemies are also procedurally generated! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827720/extras/d4a50168a1f550cad1c6c3d8cef20d54.poster.avif?t=1782506755\" width=442 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827720/extras/d4a50168a1f550cad1c6c3d8cef20d54.webm?t=1782506755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827720/extras/d4a50168a1f550cad1c6c3d8cef20d54.mp4?t=1782506755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced </strong>thrilling vehicular combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse procedurally generated</strong> locations make every run different  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>customizable car</strong> that can be changed to suit your playstyle  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A party-based RPG mechanic in which <strong>party member positioning</strong> will influence their role in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable party members</strong> that if added to your party will shift the gameplay in new ways</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Drylands is a Car RPG set in an ever-changing world that changes every run as an ancient power shifts the sands revealing previously uncovered secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like the world, enemies are also procedurally generated! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827720/extras/d4a50168a1f550cad1c6c3d8cef20d54.poster.avif?t=1782506755\" width=442 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827720/extras/d4a50168a1f550cad1c6c3d8cef20d54.webm?t=1782506755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827720/extras/d4a50168a1f550cad1c6c3d8cef20d54.mp4?t=1782506755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced </strong>thrilling vehicular combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse procedurally generated</strong> locations make every run different  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>customizable car</strong> that can be changed to suit your playstyle  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A party-based RPG mechanic in which <strong>party member positioning</strong> will influence their role in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable party members</strong> that if added to your party will shift the gameplay in new ways</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The Drylands is a Car party-based RPG. Fight for loot and explore an ever-changing procedurally generated world as the shifting sands reveal lost secrets", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827720/6f70e59702d1e3f9e64c614d44f37d3ef31739a1/header.jpg?t=1782506755", "c